  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Environment-Client-blue\" alt=\"\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fefekos.dev%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/985625288891326504?label=efekosdev&amp;color=blue\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-closed/efekos/FancyHealthBar?color=blue\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/efekos/FancyHealthBar?color=blue\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/efekos/FancyHealthBar\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/efekos/FancyHealthBar?style=flat\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/990963?logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=#f16436&amp;color=#f16436\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/fancy-health-bar?logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=#1bd96a&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=#1bd96a\" alt=\"\"></p><h1>FancyHealthBar</h1><p><strong>自 1.2 版本起，需要安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> 才能存取選項選單。若未安裝 Mod Menu，將鎖定為預設設定。</strong></p><p>此客戶端模組徹底改造了生命值顯示條，新增了許多可自訂的功能。</p><h2>生命值粒子效果</h2><p>原版生命值顯示條現已作為「原版」風格提供。預設情況下，當生命值減少時，心形圖示會碎裂成粒子效果。您可以透過選項選單自由調整粒子效果。</p><h2>多樣化風格</h2><p>您可以透過選項選單選擇不同的生命值顯示風格。如果您有新的生命值顯示風格構想，歡迎在 <a href=\"https://github.com/efekos/FancyHealthBar/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤系統</a> 中提出！</p><p>原版生命值粒子效果展示：\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/efekos/FancyHealthBar/master/img/showcase.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
